<p>This image combines five 300-second exposures through each of five filters: red, green, blue, hydrogen-alpha and oxygen-III. The data was captured with the remotely controlled iTelescope T30 at Siding Spring Observatory, Australia.</p>
<p>The telescope is a 500 mm PlaneWave operating at f/4.5. The image was processed entirely in PixInsight.</p>
"@
