<p>Comet C/2020 F8 (SWAN) was discovered in early April 2020. It was roughly 180 million kilometres from Earth when I photographed it.</p>
<p>I had an opportunity to image it early on 19 April. Its low altitude, a nearby crescent Moon and high cloud limited the result, but I captured one useful ten-minute exposure.</p>
